contentText:
The Seattle Seahawks are throwing some not-so-subtle shade after their win against the Kansas City Chiefs on Sunday (Oct. 25), so it&#8217;s a good thing that Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce know how to shake it off.

In posts on social media after the Washington team&#8217;s 20-3 victory against the Chiefs &#8212; who&#8217;d previously been undefeated this season &#8212; the Seahawks quoted some of the pop superstar&#8217;s lyrics. &#8220;Lately, I’ve been dressin’ for revenge,&#8221; they captioned an Instagram photo of mascot Blitz in a glittery getup, referencing a line from Swift&#8217;s &#8220;Vigilante Sh&#8211;.&#8221;

